function return value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("return", value)

to get left[ |]&[ |]right:
    return @intrinsic("bitwise and", left, right)

to get left[ |]+[ |]right:
    return @intrinsic("add", left, right)

function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

to get the result after one step from value:
    return value + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 & 1.5

to get the result after two steps from value:
    return the result after one step from value

to get the result after three steps from value:
    return the result after two steps from value

to get the result after four steps from value:
    return the result after three steps from value

to get the result after five steps from value:
    return the result after four steps from value

to get the result after six steps from value:
    return the result after five steps from value

ignore the result after six steps from 1
